# Models that list only a subset of classes (bare models, mali_g715 which has no
# f64 / subgroup classes) still price expressions, using class fallbacks.  A class
# a model does not have (dot4x8 on the x86 models) is priced/unavailable.
d(x: u32, y: u32) = x / y
f64(x: f64) = x * 2.5
bits(x: u32) = popcnt(x)
dot(x: u32, y: u32) = udot4x8(x, y)
model tiny { iadd: 2 }
cost d model tiny
cost f64 model tiny
cost bits model tiny
cost dot model tiny
cost d model mali_g715
cost f64 model mali_g715
cost bits model mali_g715
cost dot model mali_g715
cost d model gt1030
cost f64 model gt1030
cost bits model gt1030
cost dot model gt1030
cost dot model zen4
cost dot model skl
